WEBVTT

00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:02.460
Final Turn!

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:04.920
Damned Charging Lance!

00:00:06.380 --> 00:00:08.160
You sacrificed your own allies?!

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:10.360
Go, Phantom Blaster Dragon!

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:12.890
Crush Deathrex!

00:00:13.090 --> 00:00:15.400
The winner is Aichi Sendou!

00:00:19.890 --> 00:00:21.600
I'm strong...

00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:23.660
I've gotten stronger...

00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:28.450
Did you notice?

00:00:28.530 --> 00:00:33.460
Yeah. Brother is routinely 
weak after a fight.

00:00:33.810 --> 00:00:36.520
I don't know why it happens...

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:40.490
...but we can't let Brother fight anymore.

00:00:41.330 --> 00:00:44.050
Infirmary

00:02:14.550 --> 00:02:17.090
Here at the Vanguard National Championship,

00:02:17.090 --> 00:02:19.380
the elimination round is showing 
us one close match after another,

00:02:19.380 --> 00:02:23.380
but which teams will ultimately win their 
way through to the final tournament?

00:02:23.380 --> 00:02:24.730
<i>Oh</i>, I'm so excited!

00:02:25.540 --> 00:02:30.180
Kamui and I are going to fight the rest 
of the matches in the elimination round.

00:02:30.180 --> 00:02:31.750
What do you mean?

00:02:31.860 --> 00:02:35.050
We want you to get some more rest.

00:02:35.050 --> 00:02:37.740
You've been collapsing 
way too much!

00:02:38.050 --> 00:02:39.130
We're worried about you...

00:02:39.780 --> 00:02:41.210
I'm going to participate.

00:02:41.660 --> 00:02:46.450
You absolutely need my strength to 
get through the elimination round.

00:02:47.440 --> 00:02:48.820
Brother!

00:02:47.440 --> 00:02:48.820
Aichi!

00:02:51.110 --> 00:02:52.720
You can't fight like this.

00:02:53.250 --> 00:02:54.290
But...

00:02:54.590 --> 00:02:56.500
I'm going to the finals.

00:02:56.500 --> 00:02:57.910
With or without you.

00:03:00.170 --> 00:03:01.430
H-Hey!

00:03:04.810 --> 00:03:06.890
You didn't have to put it like that!

00:03:06.890 --> 00:03:09.690
What, are the finals more 
important than Brother Aichi?!

00:03:11.310 --> 00:03:13.200
Don't you want to go to the finals?

00:03:14.180 --> 00:03:16.110
Of course I do!

00:03:16.110 --> 00:03:18.080
But I wanna go with Brother!

00:03:18.350 --> 00:03:21.380
Then we have to win... without him.

00:03:26.060 --> 00:03:27.990
So that's what you meant.

00:03:28.270 --> 00:03:33.310
The Coiling Thread

00:03:35.380 --> 00:03:38.440
All right! We're gonna win the rest 
of our elimination round matches!

00:03:42.770 --> 00:03:44.750
H-Hey! What's wrong?!

00:03:47.290 --> 00:03:49.400
She looks just like Miss Emi!

00:03:49.520 --> 00:03:52.120
W-Why were you crying?

00:03:52.120 --> 00:03:55.980
If I don't win the next 
fight, some very bad people

00:03:55.980 --> 00:03:58.820
are going to spank me 100 million times!

00:04:04.520 --> 00:04:07.130
That's terrible! What kind 
of creeps would do that?!

00:04:07.350 --> 00:04:11.410
If we happen meet each other in 
the next match, please spare me!

00:04:14.290 --> 00:04:17.430
Kamui Katsuragi, self-assured personality,

00:04:17.430 --> 00:04:20.450
in love with Aichi Sendou's 
younger sister, Emi,

00:04:20.450 --> 00:04:24.960
past win-loss record showing a clear 
weakness when fighting against females...

00:04:31.760 --> 00:04:33.320
Why don't you come out?

00:04:37.430 --> 00:04:42.870
Misaki Tokura. Lives at Card Capital 
with her uncle, Shinemon Nitta.

00:04:43.450 --> 00:04:45.500
Calm, cool, and collected personality.

00:04:45.500 --> 00:04:50.460
Possesses a magnificent memory. Makes 
the most of it while playing Vanguard...

00:04:50.480 --> 00:04:51.380
And who are you?

00:04:51.570 --> 00:04:54.810
I'm one of your next 
opponents from Team Spyder.

00:04:54.810 --> 00:04:57.430
We've investigated all of you.

00:04:57.890 --> 00:04:59.890
AL4, Asaka Narumi...

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:04.480
You reacted just as the data predicted.

00:05:04.480 --> 00:05:09.410
Your goal is to defeat 
Asaka in this tournament.

00:05:09.410 --> 00:05:10.190
But...

00:05:10.620 --> 00:05:14.200
...have you mastered the 
Goddess of the Full Moon?

00:05:16.850 --> 00:05:19.190
Asaka beat you last time because

00:05:19.190 --> 00:05:21.050
you didn't have enough command 
of the Goddess of the Full Moon.

00:05:21.050 --> 00:05:22.680
What about this time?

00:05:23.350 --> 00:05:28.270
I know the answer to that. You haven't 
mastered the Goddess of the Full Moon.

00:05:28.270 --> 00:05:31.860
This time, too, you and your 
team are going to lose.

00:05:54.850 --> 00:05:56.610
What's wrong, Aichi?

00:05:56.610 --> 00:05:57.590
Nothing...

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:04.750
Like they said, you have to take it easy!

00:06:13.420 --> 00:06:17.500
Next up, we've got Team 
Quadrifoglio, Q4, versus...

00:06:17.500 --> 00:06:19.610
...Team Spyder!

00:06:21.600 --> 00:06:22.510
It's that girl!

00:06:22.820 --> 00:06:24.990
If you lose, you're getting a spanking!

00:06:27.500 --> 00:06:31.650
Oh, my! It looks like Sendou 
is sitting this one out,

00:06:31.650 --> 00:06:33.500
and just the two of them intend to fight?

00:06:33.500 --> 00:06:37.050
According to the rules, if Sendou 
doesn't show up by the third match,

00:06:37.050 --> 00:06:39.290
his opponent wins by default.

00:06:39.850 --> 00:06:44.780
In other words, Q4 can't lose 
either of their first two matches.

00:06:45.720 --> 00:06:47.340
He's not participating?

00:06:48.260 --> 00:06:53.250
That means you have to learn more 
about how to use Psyqualia, Aichi.

00:06:53.450 --> 00:06:55.680
Are they gonna be okay?

00:06:55.680 --> 00:06:57.690
You can have faith in Kamui the Great!

00:06:57.690 --> 00:06:59.110
HF, yo!

00:06:59.110 --> 00:07:00.950
Kourin...

00:07:02.990 --> 00:07:04.920
Here we go.  Hold on tight!

00:07:04.920 --> 00:07:06.300
Uh... right!

00:07:10.380 --> 00:07:12.410
Sorry I'm late!

00:07:13.300 --> 00:07:16.020
Miwa! What happened between you and Kourin?!

00:07:16.430 --> 00:07:19.580
Nothing. What happened was with Kai.

00:07:19.850 --> 00:07:21.740
What?! Kai, you say?!

00:07:25.140 --> 00:07:27.900
So Kai isn't here, huh?

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:33.000
You're late!

00:07:33.210 --> 00:07:35.240
You can't get too involved.

00:07:35.240 --> 00:07:36.610
It's only our duty to...

00:07:36.610 --> 00:07:37.720
I know!

00:07:39.330 --> 00:07:43.300
Please! If I lose, I'm 
going to get a spanking!

00:07:46.940 --> 00:07:48.510
It's working just like we planned!

00:07:48.740 --> 00:07:50.600
That's the game.

00:07:50.600 --> 00:07:53.390
Thanks to his sympathy for a girl 
who looks like the one he loves,

00:07:53.390 --> 00:07:55.020
his loss is in the bag.

00:07:55.140 --> 00:07:57.140
Let the first match begin!

00:07:57.590 --> 00:07:59.450
Stand up, Vanguard!

00:08:08.910 --> 00:08:12.070
Blaujunger? That's not Battleraizer.

00:08:12.070 --> 00:08:15.000
You're slow on the uptake! He played 
that in the last match too, remember?

00:08:15.280 --> 00:08:18.390
Come to think of it, he 
thought a lot about his deck

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:20.510
to prepare for this national tournament.

00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:28.780
It's a fierce battle!

00:08:29.070 --> 00:08:33.730
They each have 5 damage. 
Will Katsuragi win it here?

00:08:34.820 --> 00:08:36.990
Pleeeaaase!

00:08:39.100 --> 00:08:40.780
One last push!

00:08:40.780 --> 00:08:42.270
Ow!!

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:48.830
How dare you trick me?!

00:08:48.830 --> 00:08:53.700
Attack! Shootern Blaukruger! 
Stardust Shooting!

00:09:05.740 --> 00:09:07.900
The winner is Kamui Katsuragi!

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:10.680
He did it!

00:09:11.020 --> 00:09:13.190
Now one more match and they win the fight!

00:09:15.340 --> 00:09:17.290
Yeesh...

00:09:17.980 --> 00:09:19.370
Sorry!

00:09:19.830 --> 00:09:20.910
That's all right.

00:09:21.010 --> 00:09:25.670
It's been a while since I last looked 
forward to tormenting my prey.

00:09:28.870 --> 00:09:30.910
Let the second match begin!

00:09:33.460 --> 00:09:34.990
I'm going to draw a new hand.

00:09:52.480 --> 00:09:56.060
No Goddess of the Half Moon 
or Goddess of the Full Moon...

00:09:59.160 --> 00:10:02.630
You haven't mastered the 
Goddess of the Full Moon.

00:10:02.630 --> 00:10:06.110
This time, too, you and your 
team are going to lose.

00:10:11.090 --> 00:10:12.990
Stand up, Vanguard!

00:10:26.200 --> 00:10:27.750
I start.

00:10:27.890 --> 00:10:28.870
I'm drawing.

00:10:30.550 --> 00:10:33.150
I ride Pupa Mutant, Giraffa.

00:10:37.430 --> 00:10:40.010
With the skill of Larva Mutant, Giraffa

00:10:40.010 --> 00:10:43.620
I can take Elite Mutant, Giraffa 
from my deck and add it to my hand.

00:10:44.270 --> 00:10:45.760
That's the end of my turn.

00:10:45.760 --> 00:10:46.730
I draw.

00:10:47.320 --> 00:10:49.270
With the skill of Godhawk, Ichibyoshi...

00:10:49.570 --> 00:10:51.510
...I can check the top five cards of my deck.

00:10:52.250 --> 00:10:54.640
No Goddess of the Crescent Moon, Tsukuyomi...

00:10:55.340 --> 00:10:57.210
I ride the Crescent Moon that's in my hand!

00:10:57.550 --> 00:11:00.870
I call Psychic Bird and use its 
skill to move it to the Soul.

00:11:01.210 --> 00:11:02.430
I get to draw one card.

00:11:03.580 --> 00:11:05.190
I call Dark Cat.

00:11:09.080 --> 00:11:10.800
With Dark Cat's skill...

00:11:11.160 --> 00:11:13.390
...we can each draw one card.

00:11:13.390 --> 00:11:15.970
Thank you for increasing the size of my hand.

00:11:16.580 --> 00:11:18.110
Goddess of the Half Moon...

00:11:18.570 --> 00:11:19.900
With a boost from Dark Cat,

00:11:20.310 --> 00:11:22.030
Goddess of the Crescent Moon attacks!

00:11:23.990 --> 00:11:27.120
Drive check... Critical trigger!

00:11:27.300 --> 00:11:30.820
I give +5000 power and the extra critical 
to Goddess of the Crescent Moon!

00:11:32.950 --> 00:11:34.940
Damage trigger check.

00:11:34.940 --> 00:11:36.950
First card, second card...

00:11:37.200 --> 00:11:39.130
I stand and draw.

00:11:39.130 --> 00:11:41.950
I ride Elite Mutant, Giraffa.

00:11:42.910 --> 00:11:47.490
I call Tail Jaw, Gloom Flyman, 
and Stealth Millipede!

00:11:48.210 --> 00:11:51.450
I attack with Elite, boosted by Millipede!

00:11:51.840 --> 00:11:55.840
When Pupa Mutant is in the Soul, 
Elite's power increases by +1000.

00:11:56.160 --> 00:11:58.360
On top of that, I activate Millipede's skill!

00:11:58.610 --> 00:12:03.960
When the opponent's units are all at rest, 
my boosted unit's power increases by +4000!

00:12:06.060 --> 00:12:08.270
That's an annoying skill...

00:12:08.270 --> 00:12:10.610
Well, if all her units aren't 
at rest, she'll be okay.

00:12:10.610 --> 00:12:12.720
After you attack, your 
units are resting, right?

00:12:12.720 --> 00:12:14.540
So just don't attack!

00:12:14.540 --> 00:12:16.300
Then how can you win?!

00:12:16.300 --> 00:12:17.310
Oh, right...

00:12:19.600 --> 00:12:21.370
Damage trigger check!

00:12:21.730 --> 00:12:23.830
I activate Elite's skill.

00:12:23.830 --> 00:12:27.280
When an attack hits, I can choose 
one of your rear-guard units

00:12:27.280 --> 00:12:28.680
to not stand next turn.

00:12:29.010 --> 00:12:30.330
Dark Cat...

00:12:31.490 --> 00:12:34.000
To stop you dead in your tracks,

00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:35.760
and to thoroughly torment 
my helpless victims.

00:12:35.760 --> 00:12:38.680
That's how to fight with my Megacolony deck.

00:12:38.920 --> 00:12:41.750
This guy is seriously twisted...

00:12:41.750 --> 00:12:44.690
As opposed to you, who's too straightforward!

00:12:45.500 --> 00:12:48.550
I attack with Tail Joe, boosted by Flyman!

00:12:48.550 --> 00:12:52.450
If all my opponent's units are at 
rest, this one receives +3000 power!

00:12:54.610 --> 00:12:56.360
Damage trigger check.

00:12:57.260 --> 00:12:58.760
Draw trigger...

00:12:58.760 --> 00:13:00.410
I draw one card.

00:13:00.510 --> 00:13:03.310
It seems that your trigger timing is bad.

00:13:09.190 --> 00:13:10.190
I draw.

00:13:11.890 --> 00:13:14.870
With Goddess of the Crescent Moon's skill, 
I check the top five cards of my deck.

00:13:18.610 --> 00:13:21.150
Goddess of the Half Moon, 
Tsukuyomi, isn't there.

00:13:22.250 --> 00:13:23.850
You're going to lose again.

00:13:24.430 --> 00:13:25.910
Your team, too...

00:13:30.380 --> 00:13:32.180
I ride the Half Moon that's in my hand!

00:13:36.260 --> 00:13:39.040
With the skill of Goddess of 
the Half Moon, I Soulcharge!

00:13:39.500 --> 00:13:41.250
I call Battle Sister, Cocoa!

00:13:42.800 --> 00:13:44.950
I get to check the top card of my deck.

00:13:48.530 --> 00:13:50.550
Looks like you drew another blank...

00:13:51.130 --> 00:13:54.710
I call Oracle Guardian, Red Eye 
and Goddess of the Crescent Moon!

00:13:58.230 --> 00:14:00.820
I attack Tail Joe with 
Goddess of the Half Moon!

00:14:03.580 --> 00:14:05.140
Drive trigger check!

00:14:07.110 --> 00:14:10.960
I attack your Vanguard with Red Eye, 
boosted by Goddess of the Crescent Moon!

00:14:12.120 --> 00:14:15.120
I guard with Megacolony Battler A!

00:14:16.410 --> 00:14:20.700
I activate the skill of Battler A. It 
moves from the Guardian Circle to the Soul.

00:14:21.310 --> 00:14:22.350
That's the end of my turn.

00:14:24.460 --> 00:14:29.790
You hate my skill, so you end your 
turn with Cocoa still standing?

00:14:30.570 --> 00:14:34.630
But even so, there's no escaping my hell.

00:14:34.940 --> 00:14:37.260
I ride Death Warden, Ant Lion!

00:14:43.280 --> 00:14:45.580
I activate Ant Lion's skill!

00:14:45.580 --> 00:14:49.540
Soulcharge! And +2000 power.

00:14:49.540 --> 00:14:52.270
I call one more Ant Lion!

00:14:52.360 --> 00:14:54.800
He's got grade 3's all lined up!

00:14:54.800 --> 00:14:56.390
This guy's tougher than I thought!

00:14:57.160 --> 00:15:01.320
I attack Goddess of the Half Moon 
with Ant Lion, boosted by Flyman!

00:15:01.730 --> 00:15:03.940
I guard with Oracle Guardian, Nike!

00:15:05.660 --> 00:15:06.990
Next!

00:15:06.990 --> 00:15:10.040
I attack with my Vanguard, 
boosted by Millipede!

00:15:12.150 --> 00:15:14.170
Drive trigger check!

00:15:16.730 --> 00:15:18.540
Damage trigger check!

00:15:19.560 --> 00:15:21.380
That's the end of my turn.

00:15:25.460 --> 00:15:28.330
With Goddess of the Half Moon's skill, 
I check the top five cards of my deck.

00:15:29.780 --> 00:15:31.810
No Full Moon Tsukuyomi.

00:15:32.820 --> 00:15:34.800
There's no full moon tonight.

00:15:35.610 --> 00:15:39.780
All you can do now is plummet 
into the darkness called despair.

00:15:40.480 --> 00:15:42.690
I ride CEO Amaterasu!

00:15:50.110 --> 00:15:51.790
I Soulcharge with her skill!

00:15:51.790 --> 00:15:53.850
And then I check the top card of my deck.

00:15:55.780 --> 00:16:00.590
No matter what comes, you won't 
be able to escape from my hell!

00:16:00.780 --> 00:16:02.420
I call Amaterasu!

00:16:04.630 --> 00:16:07.790
I attack with my Vanguard, 
boosted by Dark Cat!

00:16:11.480 --> 00:16:13.280
Drive trigger check!

00:16:14.150 --> 00:16:15.550
Critical trigger!

00:16:16.000 --> 00:16:17.990
I give the extra critical 
to my Vanguard, Amaterasu,

00:16:18.420 --> 00:16:19.780
and the power to Red Eye!

00:16:19.960 --> 00:16:24.840
On top of that, since I have four cards in 
my hand, Amaterasu receives +4000 power!

00:16:31.380 --> 00:16:33.530
One... two...

00:16:34.060 --> 00:16:37.290
I attack with Red Eye, boosted 
by Goddess of the Crescent Moon!

00:16:39.900 --> 00:16:42.040
Damage trigger check!

00:16:42.520 --> 00:16:44.280
Stand trigger!

00:16:44.280 --> 00:16:47.930
I give the power to my Vanguard 
and rear-guard Ant Lion stands!

00:16:48.040 --> 00:16:50.040
I activate the skill of Red Eye!

00:16:50.040 --> 00:16:52.640
When his attack hits, I can Soulcharge!

00:16:53.240 --> 00:16:55.880
I attack with Amaterasu, boosted by Cocoa!

00:16:57.070 --> 00:16:59.110
I guard with Battler A!

00:16:59.270 --> 00:17:01.960
Battler A moves to the 
Soul through its skill.

00:17:02.330 --> 00:17:03.440
That's the end of my turn.

00:17:05.170 --> 00:17:07.620
All right! He's got 5 damage!

00:17:07.740 --> 00:17:09.860
So you've given up on 
Goddess of the Full Moon

00:17:09.860 --> 00:17:12.330
and will be going for 
Amaterasu's Megablast, huh?

00:17:13.140 --> 00:17:16.200
But I don't think it's 
going to do you any good...

00:17:16.520 --> 00:17:19.540
...since I'm going to win first!

00:17:19.540 --> 00:17:21.150
I ride Ant Lion!

00:17:21.580 --> 00:17:25.300
Now I've got seven cards in the Soul, 
and I activate Ant Lion's skill!

00:17:25.600 --> 00:17:28.560
Soulcharge! +2000 power!

00:17:28.800 --> 00:17:30.330
That makes eight cards!

00:17:30.810 --> 00:17:33.290
I call Evil Armor General, Giraffa!

00:17:33.610 --> 00:17:37.990
Here I go! From the latest Booster pack: 
Eclipse of Illusionary Shadows, Ant Lion's Megablast!

00:17:40.980 --> 00:17:44.160
The opponent's entire rear-guard can't stand!

00:17:49.720 --> 00:17:52.940
There's nothing better than 
witnessing another's torment!

00:17:52.940 --> 00:17:58.310
Like flies struggling in vain as they're 
captured by a spider or a Venus flytrap...

00:17:58.420 --> 00:18:01.800
But above all, I can't get 
enough of humans in despair!

00:18:02.310 --> 00:18:04.930
So, how about showing me a good time?

00:18:04.930 --> 00:18:06.800
I attack with Evil Armor General, Giraffa!

00:18:07.060 --> 00:18:08.930
I intercept with Red Eye!

00:18:13.390 --> 00:18:15.300
Struggle! Try to wriggle free!

00:18:15.300 --> 00:18:18.440
I attack with Ant Lion, boosted by Millipede!

00:18:19.090 --> 00:18:21.280
Added to that, Millipede's skill!

00:18:21.280 --> 00:18:25.720
If all of the opponent's units are resting, 
+4000 is added to its boosted power!

00:18:26.930 --> 00:18:29.020
Drive trigger check!

00:18:29.990 --> 00:18:31.250
Critical trigger!

00:18:31.790 --> 00:18:35.080
I add +5000 to the power 
of my rear-guard Ant Lion

00:18:35.080 --> 00:18:37.290
and give the extra critical to my Vanguard!

00:18:43.640 --> 00:18:47.860
This is the end. Satisfy 
me by writhing in agony!

00:18:48.170 --> 00:18:51.550
I attack with Ant Lion, boosted by Flyman!

00:18:51.770 --> 00:18:54.050
I guard with Nike and Dream Eater!

00:18:57.560 --> 00:18:59.270
That's the end of my turn.

00:18:59.660 --> 00:19:02.120
She protected herself! But...

00:19:02.630 --> 00:19:05.030
Only your Vanguard can attack.

00:19:05.310 --> 00:19:07.940
And Amaterasu's Megablast, 
which you're counting on,

00:19:07.940 --> 00:19:09.750
will only activate if your attack hits.

00:19:10.360 --> 00:19:13.240
Can you get by this hand 
when I have five cards?

00:19:14.320 --> 00:19:17.740
True, as it stands, I can only attack once.

00:19:18.560 --> 00:19:19.480
But...

00:19:22.160 --> 00:19:24.720
What's this? Have you given up?

00:19:31.450 --> 00:19:33.560
I'm going to the finals <i>with</i> them...

00:19:37.610 --> 00:19:39.260
With this, I can go...

00:19:39.660 --> 00:19:41.920
Gentle light that illuminates the darkness...

00:19:41.990 --> 00:19:44.230
Your smile will envelop the world...

00:19:44.230 --> 00:19:46.570
I ride Goddess of the Full Moon, Tsukuyomi!

00:19:49.090 --> 00:19:51.650
She drew Goddess of the Full Moon now?

00:19:51.900 --> 00:19:53.260
But you're too late!

00:19:54.560 --> 00:19:55.970
Counterblast!

00:19:56.420 --> 00:19:59.900
I draw two cards from the deck and put 
one card from my hand into the Soul.

00:20:00.510 --> 00:20:01.920
One more Counterblast!

00:20:05.230 --> 00:20:07.540
With this hand of five cards, 
I'll get right by you!

00:20:08.640 --> 00:20:13.130
I call Goddess of the Half Moon, Battle 
Sister Chocolat, Lozenge Magus,

00:20:13.130 --> 00:20:16.700
Oracle Guardian, Gemini 
and Meteor Break Wizard!

00:20:19.630 --> 00:20:23.310
She swapped out all five rear-guard 
units that couldn't stand?!

00:20:23.710 --> 00:20:26.780
And all three of them have enough power 
to successfully attack his Vanguard!

00:20:27.100 --> 00:20:29.840
I attack with Meteor 
Break, boosted by Gemini!

00:20:29.840 --> 00:20:32.690
Counterblast! +3000 power!

00:20:33.120 --> 00:20:36.280
I guard with Sharp Nail 
Scorpio and Phantom Black!

00:20:36.500 --> 00:20:38.900
I attack with my Vanguard, 
boosted by Lozenge!

00:20:39.390 --> 00:20:43.300
With Lozenge's skill, I add +3000 
to Goddess of the Full Moon's power!

00:20:43.570 --> 00:20:45.000
I guard with Scorpio!

00:20:45.320 --> 00:20:47.100
As long as she doesn't get a trigger...

00:20:47.780 --> 00:20:50.000
Drive trigger first check!

00:20:50.980 --> 00:20:52.220
Second check!

00:20:53.350 --> 00:20:54.640
Draw trigger!

00:20:54.850 --> 00:20:55.890
I don't believe it!

00:20:56.290 --> 00:20:59.900
I add +5000 to the power 
of my Vanguard and draw!

00:21:14.810 --> 00:21:18.450
I lost... even though I attacked 
according to the data...

00:21:18.920 --> 00:21:22.040
Vanguard isn't such an easy game 
that it can be won with data.

00:21:22.740 --> 00:21:25.200
The winner is Misaki Tokura!

00:21:25.200 --> 00:21:27.220
With two matches to zero, 
the victory goes to Q4!

00:21:30.810 --> 00:21:33.700
We're going to the finals together, Aichi...

00:21:34.160 --> 00:21:36.690
Aichi! Misaki and Kamui won!

00:21:37.910 --> 00:21:39.070
Aichi?

00:21:40.460 --> 00:21:45.830
Team Brilliant Stars, BS, easily 
won their first two fights!

00:21:46.310 --> 00:21:49.910
I, Kiriya Bidou, am going to join AL4!

00:21:50.700 --> 00:21:51.870
Ren...

00:21:52.900 --> 00:21:56.910
Q4 and BS have both passed the 
elimination round with a 2-0 victory!

00:21:56.910 --> 00:22:00.220
But which of them will be number 
one in the elimination round?!

00:22:01.020 --> 00:22:03.690
Figures. Those guys won 2-0, too...

00:22:03.690 --> 00:22:05.570
We've passed the elimination round.

00:22:05.570 --> 00:22:08.900
But the two of us are going to win the 
next fight, too, so Aichi can rest.

00:22:08.920 --> 00:22:09.580
Right!

00:23:51.110 --> 00:23:54.610
Yeesh! What kind of creep disguises himself 
as a girl that looks like Miss Emi?!

00:23:54.610 --> 00:23:55.690
Did it really look like her?

00:23:55.890 --> 00:23:58.790
Well, there are all kinds 
of Vanguard fighters.

00:23:58.790 --> 00:24:00.660
I don't care what kind of fighter 
comes my way. Between me...

00:24:00.940 --> 00:24:01.690
...and me...

00:24:01.690 --> 00:24:02.620
...we'll win our way through!

00:24:02.890 --> 00:24:03.570
Kai!

00:24:05.000 --> 00:24:05.940
A dream?

00:24:06.560 --> 00:24:09.580
I see. Kamui and Misaki are 
doing all the fighting...

00:24:09.790 --> 00:24:12.470
Next time: Another Foo Fighter.

00:24:12.470 --> 00:24:14.960
I picture Ren calling me...

00:24:14.960 --> 00:24:19.010
Brilliant Stars... You can't 
beat them without Aichi...
